  "final_span": "dancing marathon!\nGlover noted that he and the other members of Sweet Georgia Sound are excited about performing in Cleveland this weekend.\n\"This is such a beautiful region,\" Glover said. \"I always love coming to an area that is so well rounded.\"\n\"This is such an enjoyable type of music,\" Glover said. \"We want to make people enjoy themselves when they walk in and come out of the venue with a smile. We think they will have fun.\"\nHe said that the Sweet Georgia Sound will perform songs from an orchestra similar to the one Frank Sinatra sung with, possibly even including some of Greg's own selections.\n\"We\u2019re going to play a lot of classics and jazz standards, but laugh a lot in between...so come out and join us.\"\nGlover stated that he and the Sweet Georgia Sound had anticipated their arrival in Cleveland for this weekend.\n\"This is such a beautiful region,\" Glover said.",
